  "html": "<p class=\"\">A brutalist Pomodoro timer for iPhone and Apple Watch — edge-trace progress around the screen and adaptive themes</p>\n<p class=\"\">I wanted a Pomodoro that showed a unit chart and had a great visual look — something to include in YouTube videos and show my friends, like a designer watch. Elegant, Swiss-feeling, smooth advancing, with some social features like rings.</p>\n<p class=\"\">Next, I'd love to automatically ping a robot or my VPS when a Pomo session ends, or track it in my Grafana with a quantified-self vibe, or ping my Hue lights to do a little dance.</p>\n<p class=\"\">I've used Tempo a fair bit, and some folks from The Vestibule have been beta testing it for me on TestFlight too.</p>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"Tempo on iPhone\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/v1780065003/projects/tempo/1.png\" alt=\"Tempo on iPhone\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/v1780065003/projects/tempo/1.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/v1780065003/projects/tempo/1.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/v1780065003/projects/tempo/1.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/v1780065003/projects/tempo/1.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"Tempo on iPhone\" width=\"968\" height=\"2060\" style=\"--splay-rot:2.4deg;\" data-dimensions=\"968×2060\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">Tempo on iPhone</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"Tempo session view\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/v1780065005/projects/tempo/2.png\" alt=\"Tempo session view\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/v1780065005/projects/tempo/2.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/v1780065005/projects/tempo/2.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/v1780065005/projects/tempo/2.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/v1780065005/projects/tempo/2.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"Tempo session view\" width=\"968\" height=\"2060\" style=\"--splay-rot:-0.63deg;\" data-dimensions=\"968×2060\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">Tempo session view</figcaption>\n</figure>",
